@startuml FastBite_Seq_Avaliacao_Pos_Entrega
title FastBite - Sequencia: Avaliacao apos entrega

skinparam shadowing false

actor Cliente
participant "Mobile\nCustomerAppScreen" as Mobile
participant "GraphQL\nReviewMutations/Queries" as GQL
participant "ReviewService" as ReviewSvc
participant "ReviewRepository" as ReviewRepo
participant "Restaurant / Courier" as Target
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Web Restaurante" as Web

== Criar avaliacao ==

Cliente -> Mobile: abre historico de pedidos entregues
Mobile -> GQL: query getClientOrders(userId, DELIVERED)
GQL -> DB: carrega encomendas entregues
GQL --> Mobile: lista de encomendas avaliaveis

Cliente -> Mobile: submete rating e comentario
Mobile -> GQL: mutation createReview(input)
GQL -> ReviewSvc: createReview(CreateReviewDTO)
ReviewSvc -> DB: valida user, target_type e target_id
ReviewSvc -> DB: valida rating entre 1 e 5
ReviewSvc -> ReviewRepo: cria reviews
ReviewRepo -> DB: insert reviews

alt target_type = RESTAURANT
  ReviewSvc -> Target: atualiza rating_sum/rating_count do restaurante
  Target -> DB: update restaurants
else target_type = COURIER
  ReviewSvc -> Target: atualiza rating_sum/rating_count do estafeta
  Target -> DB: update couriers
end

ReviewSvc --> GQL: Review criada
GQL --> Mobile: avaliacao registada

== Consulta pelo restaurante ==

Web -> GQL: query getReviewsByTarget(RESTAURANT, restaurantId)
GQL -> ReviewSvc: getReviewsByTarget(...)
ReviewSvc -> DB: procura reviews do restaurante
GQL --> Web: lista de avaliacoes e media atualizada

== Alterar ou apagar ==

Cliente -> Mobile: edita/apaga avaliacao
Mobile -> GQL: mutation updateReview/deleteReview(userId, reviewId)
GQL -> ReviewSvc: valida dono da avaliacao
ReviewSvc -> DB: update/delete reviews
ReviewSvc -> Target: recalcula rating agregado
Target -> DB: update rating_sum/rating_count
GQL --> Mobile: historico atualizado

@enduml
